{"unit_id":"freehul__sgme#card-zh","repo":"freehul/sgme","commit":"26828e83105236b88a8ba84424e521845b851ba5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"SGME（ShiGuang Memory Engine）是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 的共享记忆桥接插件：通过 Cordis 工具、首步上下文注入、/sgme 命令和会话事件同步连接独立运行的 SGME Gateway。它可检索长期记忆、原始会话、Wiki 与技能库，注入用户画像和相关记忆，并在对话结束后保存会话供后续提炼。适合希望跨会话保留偏好、项目事实和操作知识的 DSH 用户。使用前需运行 SGME Gateway 并配置 SGME_AGENT_KEY；管理和提炼功能还使用 SGME_ADMIN_KEY。","source":"generated","evidence":["adapters/dsh/sgme-bridge/src/index.ts:138-194","adapters/dsh/sgme-bridge/src/tools.ts:37-85","adapters/dsh/sgme-bridge/src/context.ts:276-370","adapters/dsh/sgme-bridge/src/session-sync.ts:220-249"]}
{"unit_id":"freehul__sgme#card-en","repo":"freehul/sgme","commit":"26828e83105236b88a8ba84424e521845b851ba5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"SGME connects shared memory to DeepSeek Harness Web with tools, profile injection, /sgme search, and turn sync. Search memories, conversations, wiki pages, and skills; save turns for refinement. Requires a running Gateway and SGME_AGENT_KEY; SGME_ADMIN_KEY enables management.","source":"generated","evidence":["adapters/dsh/sgme-bridge/src/index.ts:138-194","adapters/dsh/sgme-bridge/src/tools.ts:37-85","adapters/dsh/sgme-bridge/src/context.ts:276-370","adapters/dsh/sgme-bridge/src/session-sync.ts:220-249"]}
