{"unit_id":"freehul__sgme#feature-01","repo":"freehul/sgme","commit":"26828e83105236b88a8ba84424e521845b851ba5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"SGME 的功能「长期记忆检索」：通过 memory_search 按自然语言、标签维度和匹配方式查询已提炼的用户或项目记忆，并返回匹配条目。","source":"generated","evidence":["adapters/dsh/sgme-bridge/src/tools.ts:37-85"]}
{"unit_id":"freehul__sgme#feature-02","repo":"freehul/sgme","commit":"26828e83105236b88a8ba84424e521845b851ba5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"SGME 的功能「会话原文搜索」：conversation_search 对保存的原始对话正文进行关键词检索，返回命中内容，补足提炼记忆未包含的细节。","source":"generated","evidence":["adapters/dsh/sgme-bridge/src/tools.ts:95-135"]}
{"unit_id":"freehul__sgme#feature-03","repo":"freehul/sgme","commit":"26828e83105236b88a8ba84424e521845b851ba5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"SGME 的功能「画像和相关记忆注入」：在 agent 首步处理时获取用户画像与项目相关记忆，将它们作为消息加入模型上下文。","source":"generated","evidence":["adapters/dsh/sgme-bridge/src/context.ts:250-276","adapters/dsh/sgme-bridge/src/context.ts:476-605"]}
